import json
# Deep-dive session: extract assistant text blocks mentioning ADDPlus with wide context
f = "17f7a693-cc90-4d3e-984e-edc0dbb37203.jsonl"
seen = []
for line in open(f):
    try: d = json.loads(line)
    except: continue
    msg = d.get("message") or {}
    role = msg.get("role","")
    if role != "assistant": continue
    c = msg.get("content")
    if not isinstance(c, list): continue
    for x in c:
        if isinstance(x,dict) and x.get("type")=="text":
            t = x["text"]
            if "ddplus" in t or "DDPlus" in t:
                seen.append(t[:3000])
for i,t in enumerate(seen):
    print(f"\n{'#'*60}\nBLOCK {i}:\n{t}")
EOF

